{"ID":"20240205170451-uy5oz0m","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205170451-uy5oz0m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170451-uy5oz0m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170536-lp7gr7h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170536-lp7gr7h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:193,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170536-lp7gr7h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"大蒜","type":"doc","updated":"20240902084639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205170536-lp7gr7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170536-lp7gr7h","updated":"20240205170536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜-20240205170536-r59juw6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711134523-6gag0o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711134523-6gag0o6","updated":"20240711134632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 510px;","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 5-20240711134522-vlwrtdc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"width: 510px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 558px;","style":"width: 548px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 2-20240711133756-x0kqdaf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 548px;\" parent-style=\"width: 558px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711133652-8ua5jlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711133652-8ua5jlr","updated":"20240711134636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 515px;","style":"width: 505px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 7-20240711134636-4flohsq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 505px;\" parent-style=\"width: 515px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 680px;","style":"width: 670px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜-20240711133652-rehfmiq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 670px;\" parent-style=\"width: 680px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711133721-4h7rb6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711133721-4h7rb6y","updated":"20240711134714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 1-20240711133721-9chfcq6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 663px;","style":"width: 653px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 8-20240711134714-t9saojx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 653px;\" parent-style=\"width: 663px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711134219-0eb0bnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711134219-0eb0bnd","updated":"20240711135000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 341px;","style":"width: 331px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 3-20240711134219-8nqv9xw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 331px;\" parent-style=\"width: 341px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 893px;","style":"width: 883px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蒜 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蒜 10-20240711135000-54crniv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 883px;\" parent-style=\"width: 893px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240711134553-vgrgexi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240711134553-vgrgexi"}},{"ID":"20240830163705-abcce3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-abcce3b","updated":"20240902084639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：大蒜"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-5wce4yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-5wce4yk","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蒜《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-cl6l4qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-cl6l4qw","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàSuàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-ceyx00m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-ceyx00m","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】蒜、蒜头"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-c5l3q2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-c5l3q2h","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为百合科葱属植物蒜AlliumsativumL.以鳞茎入药。春、夏采收，扎把，悬挂通风处，阴干备用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-engk239","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-engk239","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-6a7gnem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-6a7gnem","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】健胃，止痢，止咳，杀菌，驱虫。预防流行性感冒、流行性脑脊髓膜炎。治肺结核，百日咳，食欲不振，消化不良，细菌性痢疾，阿米巴痢疾，肠炎，蛲虫病，钩虫病；外用治阴道滴虫，急性阑尾炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-aozlocc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-aozlocc","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～5钱；外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-pufij8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-pufij8p","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-unn5x56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-unn5x56","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蒜《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-knpjtns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-knpjtns","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-yo8olka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-yo8olka","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàSuàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-xh1z1ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-xh1z1ve","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】BulbusAllii"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-9t1v4g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-9t1v4g0","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】胡蒜（崔豹《古今注》），葫（《别录》），独蒜（《普济方》），独头蒜（《补缺肘后方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-aeopsiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-aeopsiy","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为百合科植物大蒜的鳞茎。6月叶枯时采挖，除去泥沙，通风晾干或烘烤至外皮干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-h33vn3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-h33vn3h","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，具强烈蒜臭气。鳞茎大形，具6～10瓣，外包灰白色或淡棕色于膜质鳞被。叶基生，实心，扁平，线状披针形，宽约2.5厘米左右，基部呈鞘状。花茎直立，高约60厘米；佛焰苞有长喙，长7～10厘米；伞形花序，小而稠密，具苞片1～3枚，片长8～10厘米，膜质，浅绿色；花小形，花间多杂以淡红色珠芽，长4毫米，或完全无珠芽；花柄细，长于花；花被6，粉红色，椭圆状披针形；雄蕊6，白色，花药突出；雌蕊1，花柱突出，白色，子房上位，长椭圆状卵形，先端凹入，3室。蒴果，1室开裂。种子黑色。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-vf87a6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-vf87a6s","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国各地均有栽培.全国各地均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-j49x96t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-j49x96t","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】鳞茎呈扁球形或短圆锥形，外有灰白色或淡棕色膜质鳞被；剥去鳞叶，内有6～10个蒜瓣，轮生于花茎的周围；茎基部盘状，生有多数须根。每一蒜瓣外包薄膜，剥去薄膜，即见白色，肥厚多汁的鳞片。有浓烈的蒜臭，味辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-aarfhc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-aarfhc4","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-c0cumwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-c0cumwp","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-vggz9ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-vggz9ty","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味辛，温，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-2ud8qfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-2ud8qfj","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医林纂要》：\"辛甘，热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-rv4k6ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-rv4k6ox","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《随息居饮食谱》：\"生辛，热；熟甘，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-f1thc57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-f1thc57","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-l9n6pe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-l9n6pe9","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入脾、胃、肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-mx3i1jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-mx3i1jo","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"入太阴、阳明。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-6gvtqzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-6gvtqzu","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足阳明、太阴、厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-3tom9bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-3tom9bw","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-g08lhy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-g08lhy4","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"行滞气，暖脾胃，消症积，解毒，杀虫。治饮食积滞，脘腹冷痛，水肿胀满，泄泻，痢疾，疟疾，百日咳，痈疽肿毒，白秃癣疮，蛇虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-bpco6e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-bpco6e8","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"行气消积，杀虫解毒。用于感冒、菌痢、阿米巴痢疾、肠炎、饮食积滞、痈肿疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-ildr4o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-ildr4o4","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"散痈肿蠿疮，除风邪，杀毒气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-qrj6xaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-qrj6xaj","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"下气消谷，除风破冷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-k9oymmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-k9oymmk","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《食疗本草》：\"除风，杀虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-83xyyfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-83xyyfg","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"去水恶瘴气，除风湿，破冷气，烂痃癖，伏邪恶；宣通温补，无以加之；疗疮癣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-vji5yjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-vji5yjb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草，：\"健脾，治肾气，止霍乱转筋、腹痛，除邪辟温，疗劳疟、冷风、痃癣、温疫气，敷风损冷痛，蛇虫伤，并捣贴之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-08mymn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-08mymn9","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《日用本草》：\"燥脾胃，化肉食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-xfyudk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-xfyudk8","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《滇南本草》：\"祛寒痰，兴阳遭，泄精，解水毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-0awwdn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-0awwdn8","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《纲目》：\"捣汁饮，治吐血心痛；煮汁饮，治角弓反张；同鲫鱼丸治膈气；同蛤粉丸治水肿；同黄丹丸治痢疟孕痢；同乳香丸治腹痛；捣膏敷脐，能达下焦，消水，利大小便；贴足心，能引热下行，治泄泻暴肩及干湿霍乱，止衄血；纳肛中，能通幽门，治关格不通。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-bra0s1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-bra0s1t","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《四川中药志》：\"治肺结核，血痢，及崩中带下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-rq5ote5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-rq5ote5","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；生食、煨食或捣泥为丸。外用：捣敷、作栓剂或切片灸。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-21alixd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-21alixd","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-sxl97g5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-sxl97g5","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴虚火旺者，以及目疾、口齿、喉、舌诸患和时行病后均忌食。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-3ydt0op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-3ydt0op","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"凡肺胃有热，肝肾有火，气虚血弱之人.切勿沾唇。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-th2tn2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-th2tn2s","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"脚气、风病及时行病后忌食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-50lu8j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-50lu8j7","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《随息居饮食谱》：\"阴虚内热，胎产，痧痘，时病，疮疟血证，目疾，口齿喉舌诸患，咸忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-dscztcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-dscztcb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-5vccw8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-5vccw8v","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治心腹冷痛：蒜，醋浸至二、三年，食至数颗。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-gsy34if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-gsy34if","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治夜啼腹痛，面青，冷证也：大蒜一枚（煨、研、日干），乳香五分。捣，丸芥子大。每服七丸，乳汁下。（《世医褥效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-ey35u5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-ey35u5s","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治水气肿满：大蒜、田螺、车前子等分。熬膏，摊贴脐中，水从便漩而下。（《稗史》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-byon65p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-byon65p","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治臌胀：大蒜，入自死黑鱼肚内，湿纸包，火内煨熟，同食之。忌用椒、盐，葱，酱。多食自愈。（姚可成《食物本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-2f0mibb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-2f0mibb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治脚转筋：急将大蒜磨脚心，令遍、热。（《摄生众妙方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-rat8os0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-rat8os0","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治寒疟，手足鼓颤，心寒面青：独蒜一枚，黄丹半两。上药相和，同捣一千杵，丸如黑豆大。未发时以茶下二丸。（《昔济方》蒜丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-9q4427g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-9q4427g","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治疟病：独头蒜，于白炭上烧之，末，服方寸匕。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-znzspbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-znzspbp","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治食蟹中毒：干蒜煮汁饮之。（《姚僧坦集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-nf3zsa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-nf3zsa5","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治脏毒：鹰爪黄连末，用独头蒜一颗，煨香烂熟，研和入臼治丸，如梧子大。每服三，四十丸，陈米饮下。（《本事方》蒜连丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-eal27mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-eal27mb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治鼻衄不止，服药不应：蒜一枚，去皮，研如泥，作钱大饼子，厚一豆许，左鼻血出，贴左足心，右鼻血出，贴右足心，两鼻俱出，俱贴之。（《简要济众方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-ns7kfyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-ns7kfyb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治鼻衄，咯血，呕血，尿血。独头蒜两个，捣成泥状，分成两份。一份用八层麻纸包裹，置于百会穴。另一份用七层麻纸包裹，置于涌泉穴，然后在包裹之药上用热铁烙加温。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-4ob4dpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-4ob4dpz","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治肺结核：新鲜大蒜，每次一至二头，捣碎后以深呼吸吸其挥发气，每日二次，每次一至三小时。（辽宁《中草药新医疗法展览会资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-74myx1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-74myx1z","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治小儿百日咳：大蒜五钱，红糖二钱，生姜少许。水煎服，每日数次，用量视年龄大小酌用。（《贵州中医验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-4g1ju5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-4g1ju5e","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治脑漏鼻渊：大蒜切片，贴足心，取效止。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-i2ipq04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-i2ipq04","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治金疮中风，角弓反张：大蒜一升，破去心，无灰酒四升，煮蒜令极烂，并滓服一大升以来，须臾汗如雨出，则瘥。（孟诜《必效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-27oqyzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-27oqyzf","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治小儿脐风：独头蒜，切片，安脐上，以艾灸之，口中有蒜气即止。（《简易方论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-3gtgl4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-3gtgl4h","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治背疽漫肿无头者（用湿纸贴肿处，但一点先干处，乃是疮头）：用大蒜十颗，淡豉半合，乳香钱许。研烂，置疮上，铺艾灸之，痛者灸令不痛，不痛者灸之令痛。（《外科精要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-tz0t42e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-tz0t42e","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治一切肿毒：独头蒜三、四颗，捣烂，入麻油和研，厚贴肿处，干再易之。（《食物本草会纂》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-warw7xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-warw7xl","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治神经性皮炎：蒜头适量，捣烂，以纱布包裹，外敷患处。另用艾条隔蒜灸患处到疼痛为止，隔日一次。（《单方验方调查资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-f3fjmki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-f3fjmki","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治妇人阴肿作痒：蒜汤洗之，效乃止。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-msx095k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-msx095k","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治蜈蚣咬人，痛不止：独头蒜，摩螫处，痛止。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-h9snadb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-h9snadb","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蒜《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-02i3pnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-02i3pnz","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草衍义补遗》陶弘景：今人谓葫为大蒜，谓蒜为小蒜，以其气类相似也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-x2t420d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-x2t420d","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàSuàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-owdla78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-owdla78","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Garlic"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-or2uxts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-or2uxts","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】胡蒜、葫、独头蒜、独蒜"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-ui4hsd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-ui4hsd8","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-5vdrt8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-5vdrt8h","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为百合科植物大蒜的鳞茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-5jruwiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-5jruwiy","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：AlliumsativumL"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-wc4sckm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-wc4sckm","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：在蒜薹采收后20-30d即可采挖蒜头。采收的蒜头，除去残茎及泥土，置通风景至外皮干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-weklo1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-weklo1r","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】大蒜，多年生草本，具强烈蒜臭气。鳞茎大形，球状至扁球状，通常由多数肉质、瓣状的小鳞茎紧密地排列而成，外面被数层白色至带紫色的膜质外皮。叶基生；叶片实习，宽条形至条状披针形，扁平，先端长渐尖，比花葶短，宽可达2.5cm，基部鞘状。花葶实心，圆柱状，高达60cm，中部以下被叶鞘；总苞具长7-20cm的长喙；伞形花序密具珠芽，间有数花；小花梗纤细；小苞片大，卵形，膜质；具短尖；花常为淡红色；花被片披针形至卵状披形，长3-4mm，内轮的较短，花丝比花被短，基部合生并与花被片贴生，内轮的基部扩大，扩大部分每侧各具1齿，齿端成长丝状，长超过花被片，外轮的锥形；子房球状；花柱不伸出花被外。花期7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-b5j7a6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-b5j7a6b","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国各地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-28eizax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-28eizax","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-na2jxfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-na2jxfe","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学物特性适应性较强，耐寒，喜光。以肥沃、排水良好的砂质壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-rvry786","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-rvry786","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用鳞茎（蒜瓣）繁殖。采收前，选择成熟早的植株作种。采收后，从作种的蒜头中，选择粗短而直的蒜瓣作播种用。北方可行秋播或春播，南方行秋播。播前，可把蒜瓣的蒜皮剥去或把蒜瓣在水中浸泡1-2d，使蒜瓣吸水有利发芽。按行株距20cm×10cm把蒜瓣插入土中,微露尖端，不宜过深.然后覆细土2-3cm。每1hm播种量1500-2250kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163705-et7f06o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163705-et7f06o","updated":"20240902084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理出苗后，及时松土除草、追肥。追肥3-4次，其中重施越冬肥和开春肥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163707-hcdpfef","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163707-hcdpfef","updated":"20240902084638"}},{"ID":"20240830163708-maqqw19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163708-maqqw19","updated":"20240902084638"}}]}